OL,4,BMan Utd fan criticism has gone too far 
OL,5,Bat times - Berrada                     
OL,6,GManchester United chief executive Omar 
OL,7,GBerrada says some of the criticism     
OL,8,Gaimed at the club's hierarchy has      
OL,9,G"crossed a line".                      
OL,11,FIn a rare interview to Sky Sports as   
OL,12,Fhead coach Mauricio Pochettino         
OL,13,Fprepares for his first game in charge, 
OL,14,Fat Liverpool on Sunday, Berrada said   
OL,15,Fhe "understood" the frustration of     
OL,16,Fsupporters at United being 18th in the 
OL,17,FPremier League. He also said some of   
OL,18,Fthe criticism was "fair".              
OL,20,FHowever, he feels some of it has gone  
OL,21,Ftoo far.                               
